# Onsite SEO (Cursor in this repo)

There is no SEO worker. You edit this site’s source. Do not invent rankings, volume, Core Web Vitals, or ChatGPT citations.

Legal name: **TheMobileProf Technologies**. Bets (Academy, HomeGauge, …) are pages under that company unless this page already names another legal entity.

## Source of truth

The **visible page** (H1, headings, body, buttons) is truth. Title tags and meta are chrome — a designer may never have seen them. Role **gap** = said on the page, missing from the title. Role **brochure** = title/meta only; do not treat it as the topic. Role **cannibal** = the same visible phrase is strong on two URLs.

Keep **`TRAFFIC.md`** at the repo root. It names which URL owns which phrase, the ads landing, and the GA4 funnel events this site actually fires. Update it in the same diff as a new page or a new `gtag` event. Copy `.cursor/rules/traffic.mdc` from the office if it is missing.

Every content word in a proposed query must already appear on the page or the bet one-liner. If Ikeja is not on the page, do not add Ikeja. No competitor domains. No US queries. No invented impressions.

## Walk (one step at a time)

1. **Cite** — 3–6 factual sentences already on the page (who, where, offer, constraint, hours, price if shown). No invented stats.
2. **FAQ** — questions a Lagos / West Africa searcher would type that the page already answers. Visible Q&A first, then FAQPage JSON-LD that matches.
3. **Schema** — JSON-LD only for types the page supports. Organization is TheMobileProf Technologies unless the page names someone else. LocalBusiness / Course / Offer / FAQPage only from attested facts. Flag if GPTBot or Google-Extended is disallowed.
4. **Onsite** — weave cite + FAQ + schema into the page. Visible copy first (H1, subheads, body, CTAs). Chrome second (title ≤60, meta ≤155) so the snippet matches the designed page.
5. **Offsite** — listings and partners this company already knows. File those as ordinary Delivery tasks. Do not cold-email strangers or buy links.

One primary phrase per URL. Supporting phrases sit under it. Keep negatives from the copy (not the lender, invitation-only, no public checkout).

## Do not

- Invent a hidden SEO vocabulary the designer would not recognize.
- Add products, cities, or promises the visible page does not already show.
- Publish, merge, or send. Humans review the diff.
- Treat Search Console / GA4 as a crawl. Those snapshots live on the office Defaults, not in this repo.
